step The Grizzled Den
  tip Back to the Grizzled Den, the wendigo cave south-west of Kharanos where Mountaineer Gretchen camps. Flintfire's shipments lie on the cave floor, Mountaineer Cornelius is missing deep inside, and Frosthowl (level 9) keeps the Sack of Fish at the back.
  tip Careful: Wendigos, Elder Wendigos and Wendigo Shamans (up to level 8) stand close together inside the cave, so fights easily pull several at once; drawing them out one at a time with ranged attacks avoids this.
  goto 42.57,54.68 live "The Grizzled Den"
