step Kharanos
  tip Senir stands by Eric's campfire in front of the Thunderbrew Distillery; Tognus Flintfire is in the cellar west of it. Jarven Thunderbrew guards the Thunder Ale barrels in the distillery basement. Buy a Thunder Ale from Innkeeper Belm, click the guarded barrel, then hand the ale to Jarven from his quest window (there is no quest to accept); after that, the unguarded barrel takes the Barleybrew Scalder.
  turnin 98323                                -- Senir Whitebeard
  accept 287                                  -- Senir Whitebeard
