  tip Follow the road up to Ironforge and take the Mystic Ward: Brandur Ironhammer, Tiza Battleforge and Muiredon Battleforge are in the Hall of Mysteries, Tiza and Muiredon on its upper floor: the stairs up start just north-east of Brandur. John Turner, a beggar, wanders the city. He asks for ten Linen Cloth: the troggs and trolls of Dun Morogh drop it, and the Auction House sells it.
  level 12 only Paladin
  accept 2999                                 -- Brandur Ironhammer
  turnin 2999                                 -- Tiza Battleforge
  accept 1646                                 -- From the Tome of Divinity she gives you
  turnin 1646
  accept 1647
  turnin 1647                                 -- John Turner
  accept 1648
  collect 2589 quest 1648.1                   -- Linen Cloth
  turnin 1648
  accept 1778
  turnin 1778                                 -- Tiza Battleforge
  accept 1779
  turnin 1779                                 -- Muiredon Battleforge
  accept 1783
  complete 1783 only Paladin @78.32,58.09 map 1426 era -- Use the Symbol of Life on Narm Faulk
  turnin 1783 only Paladin -- Narm Faulk

step Buliwyf Stonehand
  only Paladin
  zone Ironforge
  when money>=10s
  when !skill "Two-Handed Axes" 1
  tip While you're here: learn Two-Handed Axes from Buliwyf Stonehand (Military Ward, 10 silver); two-handers level a Paladin fastest.
  train 11865                         -- Buliwyf Stonehand

step Narm Faulk
  only Paladin
  zone Dun Morogh
  tip Head back out of Ironforge and east along the road to Helm's Bed Lake. Narm Faulk lies dead by its shore: use the Symbol of Life on him. The Dark Iron Spies sneaking around the lake carry the script.
  level 12 only Paladin
  accept 1784
  collect 6847 quest 1784.1                   -- Dark Iron Script: Dark Iron Spies

