step Ironforge class quests
  only Hunter,Priest,Warlock
  zone Ironforge
  tip Belia Thundergranite is in the Hall of Arms, High Priestess Mims and High Priest Rohan in the Hall of Mysteries, Lago Blackwrench in the Forlorn Cavern.
  turnin 6086 only Hunter                     -- Belia Thundergranite: Beast Training
  accept 5639 only Priest,Dwarf               -- High Priest Rohan: Desperate Prayer, his own copy of the letter
  turnin 5639 only Priest,Dwarf
  accept 1715 only Warlock                    -- Lago Blackwrench: Gakin the Darkbinder in Stormwind takes it

step Tram to Stormwind
  zone Ironforge
  goto 78.0,51.4 "Tram to Stormwind"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Class quests in Stormwind

step Defensive Stance
  only Warrior
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Ilsa Corbin trains warriors in Old Town, near Osric's shop; the tram from Ironforge arrives in the Dwarven District, north of it. Harry Burlguard and Bartleby stand together by the Pig and Whistle Tavern there. Bartleby fights you for his mug. If Ilsa doesn't offer A Warrior's Training, go straight to Harry: he gives Bartleby the Drunk without it.
  accept 1638 npc 5480                        -- Ilsa Corbin
  turnin 1638                                 -- Harry Burlguard
  accept 1639
  turnin 1639                                 -- Bartleby
  accept 1640
  kill 6090 quest 1640.1                      -- Beat Bartleby
  turnin 1640
  accept 1665
  turnin 1665                                 -- Harry Burlguard: Defensive Stance

step Woo Ping
  only Warrior
  zone Stormwind City
  when money>=10s
  when !skill "Two-Handed Swords" 1
  tip While you're here: learn Two-Handed Swords from Woo Ping (Trade District, 10 silver); two-handers level a Warrior fastest.
  train 11867                         -- Woo Ping

